-- What the one-time grant circulars of תשע"ו and תשע"ז print in the same words (MMS-775):
-- each such declaration is declared here once and imported by every circular
-- that prints it. A circular cites the rows a declaration encodes in a note
-- where the declaration stood; above each one here is where it is printed.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `womens-work-law`
IMPORT vocabulary

-- circular תשע"ו/4, circular תשע"ו/5 and circular תשע"ז/2
GIVEN b IS A `break in the determining period`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `keeps the continuity` b IF
    CONSIDER b
    WHEN `maternity leave under section 6 of the Women's Employment Law` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `a break for reserve duty` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `paid sick leave under takanon chapter 1.25.3` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `holiday or summer recess` THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

-- circular תשע"ו/4 and circular תשע"ו/5
`the maternity leave as §1ה(1) prints it, in weeks` MEANS 26

-- circular תשע"ו/4 and circular תשע"ו/5
`§1ה(1)'s maternity leave meets the Women's Work Law` MEANS
        `the maternity leave as §1ה(1) prints it, in weeks` EQUALS `weeks of the birth and parenthood period` 12
    AND `keeps the continuity` `maternity leave under section 6 of the Women's Employment Law`
    AND `the birth and parenthood period harms no right that turns on seniority`

-- circular תשע"ו/4 and circular תשע"ו/5
GIVEN `salary month of her return` IS A NUMBER @desc in salary months from January 2016
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the last salary month after maternity leave` `salary month of her return` IS
    `salary month of her return` PLUS 1

-- circular תשע"ו/4, circular תשע"ו/5 and circular תשע"ז/2
GIVEN xs IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the monthly average of` xs IS
    IF count xs EQUALS 0
    THEN 0
    ELSE sum xs DIVIDED BY count xs

-- circular תשע"ו/4 and circular תשע"ו/5
GIVEN p IS A `purpose a payment counts for`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the one-time grant counts for` p IF
    FALSE

-- circular תשע"ו/4 and circular תשע"ו/5
`the labels below §1ה.8.1` MEANS LIST "1.ה.8.2", "1.ה.8.3", "ו"

-- circular תשע"ו/4 and circular תשע"ו/5
`the labels above §1ה.8.1 in §1ה` MEANS LIST "(1)", "(2)", "(3)", "(4)", "(5)", "(6)", "(7)", "(8)"

-- circular תשע"ו/4 and circular תשע"ו/5
`no paragraph (2) is below §1ה.8.1` MEANS
        (NOT elem "(2)" `the labels below §1ה.8.1`)
    AND elem "(2)" `the labels above §1ה.8.1 in §1ה`

-- circular תשע"ו/4 and circular תשע"ו/5
`every list of breaks checked` MEANS
    append (LIST EMPTY, (LIST `maternity leave under section 6 of the Women's Employment Law`,
                              `unpaid leave or absence treated as unpaid leave, after maternity leave or not`))
           (map (GIVEN b YIELD LIST b) `every break in the determining period`)
